@startuml epic-models
' Epic Sepsis Model and Epic Deterioration Index, from independent publications (Wong 2021; Gallo 2024) — DIP-28
' Source of diagrams/export/epic-models.png. The vendor has not published the internal architecture.
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Epic Sepsis Model and Epic Deterioration Index: what is publicly known

node "Epic EHR (vendor system, closed)" as EPIC {
  [Patient record] as REC
  [Epic Sepsis Model\npenalized logistic regression\n(inputs not published)] as ESM
  [Epic Deterioration Index\nordinal logistic regression,\n31 measures, every 15 min] as EDI
  [Alert in the EHR\n(EDI at threshold 65)] as AL
}

actor "Nurse" as N
actor "Physician" as P

REC --> ESM
REC --> EDI
EDI --> AL
AL --> N
AL --> P
N <--> P : structured huddle\nand checklist (study site)

note bottom of EPIC
  Internal architecture, data model and update
  schedule of the Sepsis Model are not public.
  Independent validation: AUC 0.63 (Wong 2021).
end note
@enduml
